 "transcript": [
  "[action] Chen Fu forgets the days and sleeps.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son, the second son) Chen Fu asks his sons about their affairs.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Chen Fu asks his sons what they have been doing.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now what have you been about?\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"I have been about buying property and buying fields and selling fields and buying more fields.\"",
  "[silence] Chen Fu says nothing.",
  "[silence] Chen Fu says nothing.",
  "[action] The second son describes his own activities.",
  "the second son (to Chen Fu, the eldest son): \"I have been about establishing a grain market in the town of Tseng Tzu.\"",
  "[action] Chen Fu listens to the second son's plans.",
  "[action] (to Chen Fu, the second son) The eldest son says nothing about his own activities.",
  "[action] Chen Fu smokes his pipe and listens to his sons.",
  "[action] (to Chen Fu) The second son explains his plans in detail.",
  "the second son (to Chen Fu): \"A large hall, I will have it built, and with a well in the center of it, and I will have a house built on the east side of the hall to live in, and I will have a court in the back of the hall for the women. And there will be an inner court for the Old Mistress, my mother-in-law.\"",
  "Chen Fu: \"Now why have you not told me this?\"",
  "[silence] Chen Fu says nothing.",
  "Chen Fu: \"Well, but this is a good thing, and we will do it.\"",
  "[silence] Chen Fu says nothing.",
  "[action] The second son stands respectfully.",
  "the second son (to Chen Fu): \"I did not know you wished it.\""
